śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ ||

śrīnāthāya namaḥ || pārvatyuvāca ||

nāthanātha kṛpāsiṃdho śrotumicchāmi saṃhitā |
bho saṃhitā mahābhāga gorakṣasya mahātmanaḥ ||1||

kathaṃ gurupadaṃ tasya kathaṃ gorakṣanāmataḥ |
kasya putra bhaved yogi karṇaccheda kathaṃ bhavet ||2||

kiṃ devaka śiṣyante mamānugraha kurvate |
brūhi bho loka nāthaṃ tejā nihitaṃ mahātmanam ||3||

śrīmahādeva uvāca ||

oṃ asya śrīgorakṣanāthotpatti kalpadrumasaṃhitāyā mahāmūlamaṃtrasya 
śrīmahākāla ṛṣiśārdūlachaṃdaḥ śrīgorakṣanāthadevatā nādabījaṃ 
daṇḍaśaktikumakaṃ kolakīlakaṃ manepsita kāmanā siddhyarthe caturvidha 
puruṣārtha sidhyarthe jape viniyogaḥ ||

ṣanyātvaṃ puṇyaśīletvaṃ gorakṣasya mahātmanaḥ |
śṛṇu priye mahadgopyaṃ gurunātha namostute ||4||

purākṛta yuge brahmā maṇidvīpe gate sati |
mārgāraṇye mahāsthāne siṃhavyāghrā hi sevite ||5||

nivāsa brahmaṇasteṣāṃ mahāyogena saṃsthitaḥ |
prādurbhāvo viṣṇumāyā brahmāgre prāptasaṃsthitā ||6||

pulocanā nāma kanyā sākṣāllakṣmī svarūpiṇī |
dṛṣṭvā viraṃcināgne vai nartasīlā pulocanā ||7||

vismitaṃ śṛṣṭi kartā ca kanyāṃ darmātimātmanaḥ |
amoghavīryasaṃprāpya garmiṇī sā pulocanā ||8||

dadhāragarbhaṃ pūrṇeṣusāsapūrṇesu lakṣaṇāḥ |
śubhamāse śubhepakṣe sutithau śubharāśibhiḥ ||

brahmapatnyāṃ śiśurjāta saṃyogādviśravā muniḥ |
jātakarmādikaṃ sarvaṃ viśraveṇa yathā kṛtaḥ ||10||

svabhrātāpatnimātā syād brahmānaṃdena sundaraḥ |

<1b>

godhano nāma nṛpate tasya kanyā sulocanā ||11||

tatsutāyāṃ brahmavīryāt saṃvabhūva maheśvarī |
nāmaṃ cakāra vidhivad gorakṣakṛta viśravāḥ ||12||

śiśoḥ dine dine vṛddhi śuklapakṣe ca candramāḥ |
brahmaputro mahāyātrā sādhyobhutkā maheśvari ||13||

yogeśvaro yogamūrti brahmaputra varānane |
prāpte putravatī nārī mahāharṣavatī śubhā ||14||

dine dine varddhamānaṃ saptavarṣa bhavecchibhuḥ |
bhārgavaṃ gurusaṃprāpya vipāraṃbhakṛtākila ||15||

caturvedokta śāstrāṇi sarvaṃ sāṃkhyāyanādikam |
tasmin kāle gurorbhāryāṃ gorakṣeṇa ca sevanam ||16||

gurordṛṣṭvā māhākrodhaṃ karṇacicchedasikṣataḥ |
tataḥ śramābhārgavasya prāptā śrīviśravā muni ||17||

mama bhrātā kathaṃtena karṇaṃ ciccheda kurvati |
dṛṣṭvācenbhrātarā nāryā karṇaṃ chedati gotsave ||18||

mahākrodhairgurudaṃṣṭrā duṣṭatvaṃ bhārgavo muni |
mama bhrātā kathaṃ tena karṇaṃ ciccheda kurvati ||

kṣaṇe bhasma mahaṃsaknu sāpaṃ te brahmakaṇṭaka ||19||

brahmaputravaca śrutvā chedo mātra nayātitaḥ |
kāraṇaṃ yacchṛṇu prāṇa gorakṣo karṇachedakaḥ ||20||

tadā gorakṣa śrīmānvai gatatyaktā ca bhārgavaḥ |
gorakṣopi ca tatsthāne guruṇā karṇachedakāḥ ||21||

na brahmadharmamahaṃ kurvaṃ gorakṣadharmaṃ bhaje |
guruṇādi yatāṃ bheṣaṃ karṇabhaṅgaṃ śikhāchinat ||22||

iti bhrātaravākyāni śrutvā gacchati viśravāḥ |
vṛttānta kṛtayā māsa parameṣṭhi gatā pure ||23||

jalaṃdharo matsyendrādi dattātreyādi gorakṣaḥ |
sikṣayāmāsaśāstrāṇi gorakṣadharma paraṃ śiva ||24||

trayo śiṣya mahābhāga gorakṣasya varānane |

<2a>

karṇabhaṃgaṃ svayaṃ kṛtya gaṃdharva asikaṃ kaṇaiḥ ||25||

nādaṃ vādya kalādaṇḍa padmarāgaiḥ suśobhanaiḥ |
paraṃbrahma svayaṃ vidyāmāpāstotuṃ pracakrame ||26||

prakāreṇa svayaṃ dharma prakāśāntyaṃ varānane |
gorakṣasya pathotpatti bhārate paṭhyate sadā ||27||

devo vā mānuṣo vāpi yakṣadānava kinnarāḥ |
nityaṃ paṭhati yo dhīmān ciṃtāmaṇi bhavet priya ||28||

[iti śrīkalpadrumavivekinyāṃ yogābhyāse haragaurisaṃvāde śrīgorakṣotpatti 
dharmaparimāṇo nāma gorakṣaguṭikāyāṃ prathamastaraṅgaḥ] ||


śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ || 

śrīmahādeva uvāca ||

śṛṇu priye gorakṣasya paṃcāṅgādiṣu me kṛtā |
bhavān bhaktyā prasādena śrāvayāmi niśāmaya ||1||

prathamaṃ dvādaśā svānigorakṣā dhīnatā guroḥ |
prasādaṃ maṅgalā mātrāmekacittaṃ varānane ||2||

oṃ asya śrīgorakṣanātha dvādaśanāmastotramaṃtrasya śrīmahākāla 
ṛṣiranuṣṭupchaṃdaḥ śrīgorakṣanātha devatā śrībījaṃ chatra hastāśakti 
kurmakallolakīlakaṃ manepsitakāmanā sidhyarthe dvādaśanāma jape viniyogaḥ ||

prathamaṃ gorakṣaṃ nāma dvitīyaṃ brahmanandana |
tṛtīyaṃ gururūpaṃ ca caturthaṃ nādahastakam ||3||

paṃcamaṃ nādapādaṃ ca vedarūpaṃ ca ṣaṣṭhakam |
saptamaṃ bhairavaṃ rūpaṃ rudrarūpaṃ tathāṣṭamam ||4||

navamaṃ siddhirūpā ca daśamaṃ chatradhāraṇaḥ |
sundarī sevakaṃ caiva ekādaśa varānane ||5||

dvādaśaṃ pādukā rūpaṃ (* *) vyākhyāni me tataḥ |
paṭhati prāṇadhārī ca sarvasiddhirbhavetkila ||6||

<2b>

gorakṣaṃte prasannostu vāñchāsiddhirbhavaṃti hi ||7||

[iti śrīkalpadrumavivekinyāṃ yogābhyāse haragaurīsamvāde 
śrīgorakṣadvādaśanāmastotraṃ gorakṣaguṭikāyāṃ dvitīyapaṭalaḥ] ||2||


śrīgorakṣāya namaḥ ||

śrīpārvatyuvāca ||

bho nātha devadevatvaṃ sarvajñosi dayānidhe |
kathaṃ gorakṣanāthasya kavacaṃ maṃtravigraham ||1||

śrotumicchāmi lokeśa ājñāṃ kuru mahāmate ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca ||

dhanyatvaṃ puṇyaśīletvaṃ śrānayāmi varānane ||2||

gorakṣasya mahāmaṃtraṃ kavacaṃ me prakāśitā |
śṛṇu priye śailakanye vadāmi kila sāṃpratam ||3||

asya śrīgurugorakṣanātha mahākavaca stotramaṃtrasya śrīmahākāla ṛṣiḥ 
paṃkticchaṃdaḥ śrīgorakṣanātha devatā hrīḥ bījaṃ śrīḥ śakti chatra 
dharākīlakaṃ mama sarvadehavajra kṛtyarthe mahākavacastotra jape pāṭhe 
viniyogaḥ ||

gnāṁ aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ | gnīḥ tarjanibhyāṃ namaḥ | gnūṁ 
madhyamābhyāṃ namaḥ | gnaiṁ anāmikābhyāṃ namaḥ | gnauṁ 
kaniṣṭhikābhyāṃ namaḥ | gnaḥ karatalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ | eṣaṃ 
krameṇa hṛdayādi nyāsaḥ ||

dhyānam ||

vande gorakṣanātha sāṃkṛti mukhā brahmasutāvārddhakāḥ lokādevaguro 
surendrayajaṭā brahmendra yogeśvarāḥ || mārgāpādanarendranāda sahitāmūrtī 
tripuṃḍrādharāḥ bhūtapreta uraṅgamāpaśupate maṃtrādhipā śrīgurum || 

iti dhyānam ||

<3a>

mūlamaṃtraḥ ||

oṃ gnūṁ oṃ gorakṣanātha svāhā iti mūlaṃ ||

yathāśaktimūlaṃ japitvā kavacaṃ kuryāt || 

gorakṣaṃ ca śiro rakṣenyātumāṃ guru mūrtinā | 
bhālaṃ lalāṭe nāthena pātutvāṃ rakṣaśaṃkara ||4|| 

netre dvaṃdve caṃdra netrai rakṣaṃ tu vighnanāśakā |
prāṇaṃ rakṣet ghoṭakena gorakṣeṇa sadāvatu ||5||

mukhaṃ rakṣen maṃtranāthaṃ jihvāṃ rakṣet sadā guru |
karṇaṃ rakṣen mahākāla śrotraṃ gorakṣamūrtinā ||6||

maunvaṃ(?) rakṣed bhīmacaṇḍa gorakṣeṇa sadādhipaḥ |
bālarakṣedraktamūrti śikhāgorakṣamūrtinā ||7||

kuṇḍalaṃ pātu caṇḍaṃ ca kuṇḍale (*) rakṣaḥ |
dagnaṃ(?) rakṣeva vyāghrapāda gorakṣamūrti maheśvaraḥ ||8||

vakṣaṃ pātu ugracaṇḍa sadārakṣaṃ tu gorakṣaḥ |
grīvāṃ rakṣet kaṃkarūpaṃ sarvaṃ gorakṣamūrtinā ||9||

stanau pātu caṃdrabiṃvastuṃ usnādgorakṣeṇa ca |
bāhupātu virūpākṣa brahmaputraṃ ca gorakṣaḥ ||10||

parṇaṃ rakṣet puṇya vaṃcamaṃtrarājaṃ ca gorakṣaḥ |
sarvāṃguliṃ bahirājā tejorūpaṃ ca gorakṣaḥ ||11||

nakhaṃ pātu namo devatānya devaṃ ca gorakṣaḥ |
nābhau rakṣet mahābhīma kuṃḍīrūpaṃ ca gorakṣaḥ ||12||

udaraṃ annakūṭaṃ ca annarūpaṃ ca gorakṣaḥ |
kaṭiṃ pātu mahādeva yogamūrtiṃ ca gorakṣaḥ ||13||

liṃgaṃ rakṣet kāmadeva kāmarūpaṃ ca gorakṣaḥ |
alakaṃ rakṣate saiva mattonmattaṃ ca gorakṣaḥ ||14||

aṇḍaṃ rakṣedralarūpa golakaṃ gorakṣastathā |
ūrūṃ rakṣed gadā rūpamahaṃ gorakṣarūpitā ||15||

ulakaṃ pātu sukhadā ukhaleśvara gorakṣaḥ |
dhīrakṣentālamūrtiṃ padmatālaṃ ca gorakṣaḥ ||16||

<3b>

pādaṃ rakṣet puṇḍrakasya hanurūpaṃ ca gorakṣaḥ |
pādāṅgulī śrīdharaṃ ca viśvarūpaṃ ca gorakṣaḥ ||17||

carmaṃ rakṣeccandramūrti tejo mūrti gurustathā |
majjāraktamayaṃ pātu tvakākṣaraṃ sālvamūrtinā ||18||

asthirakṣedarṇavānāṃ sāndramūrti maheśvaraḥ |
atirakṣenmahākāla bhairavatva ca gorakṣaḥ ||19||

sarvāṅgabālakaṃ pātu muktacandreśvara priye |
bhāryāṃ rakṣedviṣṇurūpa vande gorakṣasāmbhavaḥ ||20||

putraṃ rakṣedbrahmaputra pulomānanda gorakṣaḥ |
mātṛpitṛ sadārakṣeddhīmatā gorakṣa svayam ||21||

mārgaṃ rakṣecchatra dharā sundarī sevaka svayam |
rājadvāre guru sākṣādrakṣedvā ca svarūpitā ||22||

sarvāṅgaṃ sarvakāryeṣu rakṣāṃ kurvaṃtu gorakṣaḥ |
iti kavaca vyākhyātaṃ gorakṣasya varānane ||23||

kavacasya phalaṃ hyasmiṃ śṛṇu lokeśvarī priye |
brahmakṣatriya viṭvaṃśā trayojātāmupāsitā ||24||

yogībheṣaṃ vā svarūpaṃ trikāle kavacaṃ kṛtā |
bhurjapatre likhed yaṃtraṃ bāhau vā dhārayiṣyati ||25||

tasya dehaṃ bhavedvajra vṛtrahā vajra na sthirāḥ |
asikaṃkaṇanodadhāntaḥ ṛkṣavyāghrādito bhayāt ||26||

vajradeha bhavet tasya satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
saṃsāre lokavāsaṃ yadyonarāmarakinnarāḥ ||27||

trikāle paṭhate nityaṃ gorakṣa kavacaṃ yathā |
sarvān bhaya vināśeṣu vajradeha samo bhavet ||28||

na śastra bhaya teṣāṃ vai na kāla bhayavai bhavet |
gorakṣasya prasādena vāṃchāsiddhi bhavet kila ||29||

<4a>

mane kṛtā gorakṣasya kavacaṃ yadvarānane |
punargorakṣanāthasya kiṃ bhūyaḥ śrotumicchasi ||30||

[iti śrīkalpadrumavivekinyā yogābhyāse haragaurīsaṃvāde gorakṣanātha kavacaṃ 
nāma śrīgorakṣaguṭikāyāṃ tṛtīyapaṭalaḥ] ||3||


śrīgorakṣanāthāya namaḥ ||

śrīpārvatyuvāca ||

bho devabhojagaṃ nātha gorakṣahṛdayaṃ katham |
kathaṃ maṃtra kathaṃ yaṃtra kiṃ kiṃ bhāva vadāmi te ||1||

śrotumicchāmi satyaṃ taṃ vistarādvadaśaṃkara |
gorakṣasyapimānāya mama tulya kathaṃ bhavet ||2||

śrī īśvara uvāca ||

śṛṇu priye śailajātvaṃ pravakṣāmi samāhita |
gorakṣasya hṛdayaṃ yaṃtrān nānāvidhānakam ||3||

guhyamatyanta me prāṇa sapto yaṃ dhāraṇāmyaham |
tava bhaktyā prasādena śṛṇu te mama vākyata ||4||

purā brahmatyutaḥ yeṣāṃ viśraveṇa yathocitaḥ |
nāmamādikaṃ vālagorakṣoyaṃ mahātmanaḥ ||5||

paścād bhārgavaguruṇā karṇacicchedabhagnataḥ |
duḥkhī bhūtvā imāṃ bāla brāhmaṇānāṃ ca godhanam ||6||

rakṣāṃ cakāra vidhivad yogendrasya dvijeśvaraḥ |
kālamekaṃ daivayogād gogaṇai sahitā vane ||7||

sarvattulyaṃ ca garalaṃ bhakṣayaṃ tu vidhe suta |
garale pīḍitā teṣāṃ mṛtyukālavasaṃ gataḥ ||8||

sarve gavā dṛśyamāna āvaliparitaḥ sthitān |
cakrurodana sarve gau hāhākārāgavegaṇā ||9||

brahmaputraśavā dṛṣṭvā gaveṣāṃ raudanaṃ yathā |
me dṛṣṭvā tena ākāśāt karuṇāṃbhud varānane ||10||

<4b>

teṣāṃpi brahmaṇā putra dvijagosevakastathā |
mṛtadehe ahaṃ gatvā avisaṃkitaniścayaḥ ||11||

utthitohaṃ mṛto dehā dṛṣṭvā gaugaṇaharṣitā |
nāmaiṣāṃ viśrave tasya kāryaṃ ca gaugaṇena ca ||12||

karuṇā me hṛtprāpya gavā sarve vilapyatām |
yogendrasya gṛhe gatvā gavāṃ saṃtoṣakāraṇam ||13||

gorakṣasya śarīre me praveśaṃ caiva pārvati |
na jñāti iha saṃyoga nānā māyāṃ kṛtā maham ||14||

unmatta bhāvamāpanna yogendreṇa dṛṣṭvā mama |
yatheṣṭaṃ gacchabhagava unmādaṃ bhāvabālakaḥ ||15||

kiṃkaromi bhogahatā gaccha bāla pathā sukham |
iti śrutvā mayā gaurī niścayā māsate gṛhāt ||16||

daśāṃśamekamaṃśaṃ me datvā te brahmaṇaṃ sutāt |
mama tulya bhaved gaurī kāraṇaṃ yanmaheśvarī ||17||

paścān me ne kṛtā yeṣāṃ dvādaśākhyāṅga hi sutān |
kavacaṃ ca yathā kurvan yattaṃddhṛdayakaṃ śṛṇu ||18||

oṃ asya śrīgorakṣanāthasya hṛdayastotra nānāmādi maṃtrasya śrībhairava 
ṛṣiḥ paṃkti chaṃdaḥ śrīgorakṣanātha devatā aiṁ bījaṃ klīṁ śakti 
chatradharā kīlakaṃ caturvidha puruṣārtha sidhyarthe hṛdaya jape viniyogaḥ ||

oṃ aiṁ gmlvryīṁ aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || klīṁ gorakṣa glūṁ ṣlmīṁ(?) 
tarjanībhyāṃ namaḥ || oṃ chatradharā śrīṁ gorakṣa guru (*?) 
madhyamābhyāṃ namaḥ || oṃ vraṁ vidhinandanā dhrīṁ sklhīṁ anāmikābhyāṃ 
namaḥ || oṃ anyadharmaśāline hraṁ rājeśvarāya rakṣa (2) thprjrīṁ(?) 
kaniṣṭhikābhyāṃ namaḥ || oṃ aiṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ gorakṣanātha māṃ rakṣa (2) karatala 
kara pṛṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ | 

<5a>

evaṃ hṛdayādi ||

atha ādidhyānam ||

yonindraiḥ hara asaṃbhāla tilakaiḥ yogendra mūrti svayaṃ ekākṣiṃ tripurā maheśa 
kulakāṃchatraṃ dharaṃtī sadā |
gorakṣaṃ vidhinandanaṃjati balā brahmatyavedairyutāṃ siddhitvaṃ parameśvaraṃ 
gurumahātrailokya rakṣāṃ kuru ||19||

atha mūlaṃ ||

oṃ hriṁ hriṁ hriṁ hriṁ hriṁ gorakṣanātha sarvaduṣṭānāṃ vācaṃ mukhaṃ 
stambhaya (2) māṃ rakṣa (2) siddhiṃ dehi (2) eka netre svāhā ||

iti gorakṣamūla ||

praṇavaṃ paṃcamāyā ca devanāmasamuccaret |
sarvaduṣṭādi vācābhyāṃ staṃbhaṃ nāśaya (2) ||20||

ātmākaṃ rakṣaśabda dvaṃ siddhiṃ ca vahni jāyayā |
saptaviṃśan mahāmaṃtraṃ maṃtravarṇānanekasa ||21||

dvicatvāriṃśatiṃ vargān gorakṣeśvara pārvati |
śrīyaṃtravasinī siddhā gurumūrti namāmyaham ||22||

bījalakṣapramāṇena navalakṣapramāṇataḥ |
niśāyāṃ paścime yāme japitvā mṛga āsane ||23||

rudrākṣamālāsaṃyuktāṃ puraścaraṇapūrvakam |
sādhanaṃ gurudevāya trailokya rakṣaṇāya ca ||24||

duṣṭaśatruvināśāya maṃtrasiddhi kṛtāya ca |
brahmacarya vidhānena gorakṣasādhanaṃ kṛtā ||25||

haviṣyānnaṃ ca bhuñjīyāddhastakāryaṃ samācaret |
saptatriṃsallakṣajapaṃ niśiṃkāleṣu uttama ||26||

maṇḍapaṃ kārayā māsa kadalīstaṃbhasaṃyutā |
yajñasālā prakurvanti juhuyāt tilarāyikā ||27||

ghṛtasaṃyogabhuṃjānaṃ ghṛtahomaṃ ca kārayet |

<5b>

japasya sādhakān sarve daśāṃśaṃ juhuyāt kila ||28||

taddaśāṃśaṃ tarpayiṣyet taddaśāṃśaiva mārjayet |
taddaśāṃśairbrahmakanyā pūjayed dvija bhojanam ||29||

hemasya sthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā yaṃtraṃ gorakṣa dhīmatā |
likhet paṃcopacāreṇa pūjayed gurudevatām ||30||

trikoṇaṃ paṃcavṛttāni dalaṣoḍaśasaṃyutām |
punarvṛttacatuṣkoṇa māyā bījena veṣṭayet ||31||

dvāraṃ catuṣṭayaṃ kṛtvā pādukā dvāradeśataḥ |
iti gorakṣayaṃtrāṇi sādhakena sadārcayet ||32||

subudhaiḥ sadījā sarve pūjayed gurudevatām |
siddhiṃ gorakṣa maṃtreṇa vāṃcchasiddhirbhavet kila ||33||

madhye ekādaśe rudre imāṃ rudravarānane |
ekaṃ bhavati gorakṣa smaret sarvaughanāśanam ||34||

karmaṇāmanāvācā yatkiṃcit kṛtasādhanam |
vilīnaṃ sarvapāpānāṃ jaḍamūlo bhaviṣyati ||35||

ṣaḍkarmasaṃyutāṃ maṃtraṃ ḍaṃkinīṃ dhvaṃśakārakā |
nānā bhaya vināśānāṃ paracakra vighāṭakān ||36||

māraṇaṃ mohanaṃ caiva vaśīkaraṇastaṃbhanam |
uccāṭanaṃ krameṇaiva samādhāna bhaviṣyati ||37||

saptatriṃśajjapenmaṃtraṃ homatarpaṇa bhojanam |
mārjanaṃ sarvakāryāṇi maṃtrasiddhi bhavet priye ||38||

kṛtvā paścādyaṃtrarāja kāryā bhāveṣu pūjanam |
maṇḍapaṃ kārayāmāsa sarvakāryeṣu tatparaḥ ||39||

puraścaraṇa kāleṣu sūnyāraṇye japet sadā |
siddhiṃ prāpyaṃ tu paścāt tvāṃ yaṃtreṣu pūjanaṃ sadā ||40||

balidānaṃ prabhātkāle rātri kāle pṛthak pṛthak |

<6a>

paṃcopacāraiḥ tāṃ pūjāṃ sarvakāryeṣu sādhakāḥ ||41||

kāryabhāvī baliṃ dadyājjuhuyādagni sāṃnidhim |
taṃtre mate śailaputri agnisthāpana pūrvakam ||42||

sarvakāryeṣu gorakṣa pūjānāṃ tu vidhānata |
vistarācchṛṇu bho gaurī sarvameva vadāmite ||43||

ādau siddhi kṛtā kārye ajāputra baliṃ dadet |
aṣṭasiddhirbhavet sarve sādhakaiḥ kila prāpnuyāt ||44||

śatrūṇāṃ māraṇaṃ kārye kolajaṃtu baliṃ dadet |
trirātre maraṇaṃ teṣāṃ śatruvargā varānane ||45||

vidyākāraṇa kāryeṣu meṣarūpaṃ baliṃ dadet |
mohane haṃsamaudgalyāṃ kaliṃgai śṛṃgasarvatā ||46||

vaśīkāraṇakāmeṣu matsyarūpaṃ baliṃ dadet |
uccāṭane ca unmāde mahiṣaṃ naraghātite ||47||

kāmye kārye svastha svasthe vedamārgeṇa pūjitān |
pāyasairmadhurālāpaiḥ pūgītāṃbūlasaṃyutaiḥ ||48||

gorakṣo gurudevastu sa sākṣādrudra rūpitā |
yati krīḍaṃ devasya brahmaputra namostute ||49||

brahmaputrāya vidmahe gorakṣāya dhīmahi |
vāyumārga pracodayāt |

iti gāyatrī || iti puraścaraṇakramaḥ || 

punaranyat pravakṣāmi mālāmaṃtrādi śaṃkari |
japecchrī gurudevasya mālāmaṃtra varānane ||50||

mama tulya bhavatyeva sāṃprataṃ loka pūjitam |
mahāśreṣṭhaṃ surendrādi madhye bhārata khaṇḍata ||51||

atha mālā nyāsaḥ ||

kmlvryaṁ kaṁ ṣaṁ kṣaṁ aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ |
vymāṁ(?) tarjanībhyāṃ namaḥ ||

plrvyūṁ(?) madhyamābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
pmlvrvprīṁ(?) kanikābhyāṃ namaḥ ||

kvṣarryrīṁ(?) karatala karapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ |

<6b>

evaṃ krameṇa hṛdayādi nyāsaḥ |

atha dhyānam || 

trailokye gurumūrtinā janamanā brahmasutāṃ śrīmukhāṃ rudrāṃśāṃ bhaya 
nāśakāṃ yugabhujāṃ yogeśvarī sevakāḥ ||

taṃ vaṃde gururakṣa gorakṣa pade jvālā mahānartakāṃ śrīcakreṣu virājitā 
gurukule gorakṣanāthaṃ bhaje ||52||

atha trikāla dhyānam ||

ādau sātvikī ||

vaṃde gorakṣanāthaṃ prathita guṇamaye yogasaṃyoga mūrte brahmāṇḍe 
yogalabhyaṃ padamiha labhate śrīgurodhaumya devāḥ ||

jālaṃdharyādi siddhān surapati sukhadāṃ yogi yogendra rūpāṃ unmattāṃ tvāṃ 
udāsīṃ jaya jaya gurute vaṃditādesamūrtiḥ ||53||

iti sātvikī || 

lokelokānulūke naragaṇegītasaṃvādyarūperarce nānāvicāraiḥ padamiha labhate 
juhuyāt homaghāṭe || 
bhojyairmāṃsādi kṣiptaṃ vijaya jayate bhaktarājñāśramāṃtā karṇaṃkṣiptāṃta 
indriṃsu phala sa guruṇāvaṃditāṃ nityarājam ||54||

iti rājasī ||

mahāmbhojatulyāṃ māhārosarūpāṃ jaṭājūṭaśubhrāṃkarālākṣidiptām ||

kṛtāṃ madyapānāṃ mahonmattarūpāṃ jagadrāvayattāṃ mahārudrarūpām ||55||

iti tāmasi dhyānam ||

atha mālāmaṃtraprāraṃbhaḥ ||

śrīgurave namaḥ ||

oṃ gurugorakṣanātha hūṁ samasamaśrīṁ śiva aṃśayutaṃ hrīṁ 
pramayaprathaprasādhakaṃ rakṣa (2) uṁ dhrūṁ dhrīṁ varddhaya (2) māninī 
gorakṣanātha hraṁ cakramūrte suṃdarī sevakāyallīṁ llṁ llīṁ oṃ gurudevadeva hā 
hā hā mama sarvaśatrūṇāṃ vācāṃ mukhaṃ staṃbhaya staṃbhaya jīvaṃ māraya 
māraya

<7a>

sakalasurāsuranarayakṣagaṃdharvakinnarasakalarākṣabhūtapretapiśāca 
brahmarākṣasakuṣmāṇḍādi ḍākinī śākinī hākinī nānāduṣṭānāṃ doṣaṃ 
nāśaya nāśaya bhayaṃ haraya haraya kīlaya kīlaya māṃ sadārakṣa bho 
gurugorakṣanātha bhavamārijacarane strīṁ namāmi ||

iti mālāmaṃtraḥ ||

etanmālāsadājāpyaṃ aṣṭasiddhi samo bhavet |
satyaṃ satyaṃ bhaved bhāve śraddhāyukte varānane ||

atha vṛhaddhyānam ||

yogīndrai śaśi arka tulya vadanaiḥ śāktā sadāsātvikī sāmudrī śarirātmakaiḥ 
yugabhujāyāmātapatraṃ dharā ||

cakraṃ pātratriśūlamastrasubhitā tejāgni tulya prabhā ūrṇānāṃ upavīta 
rudragrathitā vaṃde guroḥ pādukau ||

atha madhyamadhyānam ||

satyānmā vidurāmukhāḥ paśupati rudrāṃśamekaiḥ 
yutābrahmānandanarājasīharamukhā bhūme nṛpaṃ cihnitā ||

karṇe rakṣa tu bhagna kuṇḍalamati ratnādi bhuṣojvalāḥ vyāptā muṇḍi smaśāna 
bhasma dharitā rudrākṣamālā yutā |

aṃtya dhyānam ||

ādau bhairava lokanātha vadanā sā yujyamukti pradāsiṃhādyākratu nāyakā 
suramukhābhavyāṃ karālī mukhā ||

devī sevakatāmasātta gurave jñānārtha loke svarāḥ nityaṃ bhaktajanārta duḥkha 
haratāṃ vaṃde gaverakṣakām ||

etat hṛdayavyākhyātaṃ nityaṃ paṭhati dhīmatā |
vāṃchārthasiddhimāpnoti labhate paramaṃ padam ||

gorakṣanātha hṛdayaṃ kathitā yadvarānane |
menetvaṃ bhakti bhāvena gorakṣasaṃhitā mayā ||

<7b>

punaḥ śṛṇu śailaputri pūjāvyākhyāna pārvati |
kīlakaṃ tatpravakṣyāmi ekacittaṃ kuru priye ||61||

[iti śrīkalpadrumavivekinyāṃ yogābhyāse haragaurīsaṃvāde gorakṣa guṭikāyāṃ 
śrīgorakṣanātha hṛdayaṃ nāma caturthapaṭalaḥ] ||4||

śrīgorakṣāya namaḥ ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca ||

gorakṣasya vidhānena cakāra vidhipūrvakam |
pūjāvidhānaṃ bho gaurī etesāmagnikaṃ śṛṇu ||1||

gaṃgājalaṃ dadhi kṣaudraṃ sarkarāmadhupāyasam |
śrīkhaṇḍaṃ malayaṃ bhūtaṃ raktacandanasiṃdurāḥ ||2||

cākṣataṃ ca tilaṃ caiva yavaṃ ca bilvapatrakam |
nānasugaṃdhapuṣpāṇi guggulaṃ silhakādikāḥ ||3||

dīpaṃ nānāvidhānāṃni naivedyāni ca pārvati |
phalaṃ ca nānā pakvānnaiva liṃnānāvidhāni ca ||4||

homadravyaṃ cakārā sugoghṛtādiṣu pūritam |
divyavastrasamānīya gairikādi kṛtā yathā ||5||

maṃtraiḥ pūjā ca gurave ca kāraśuddhadyānasaḥ |
maṃtraṃ śṛṇu maheśāni pravakṣyāmi mayākila ||6||

oṃ hrīṁ gorakṣanāthāya gurave śrīṁ sarvasiddhi mūrtaye gurugorakṣanātha hūṁ 
deśakāla prapūjyante mama sakalakuṭumba śiṣyādikānāṃ 
āyurārogyasukhavṛddhikāmanārthe yathāśāstrokta phalaprāpti kāmayathāśakti 
paṃcopacāreṇa pūjayāmi || 

iti saṃkalpaḥ ||

tata digbandhanam ||

oṃ pūrve śrīṁ gurugorakṣanātha hraṁ indrodevakādhyāyadiśaṃ pūrvarakṣa 
rakṣa svāhā ||

<8a>

oṃ āgnaye haṁ oṃ śrīgurugorakṣanātha hrīṁ agni devatākādhyāyakoṇa 
āgneyaṃ rakṣa rakṣa svāhā || 

oṃ yamo hraṁ śrīgurugorakṣanātha pitṛdevatākādhyāyadiśi dakṣiṇaṃ rakṣa 
rakṣa svāhā || 

oṃ nir(-)ṛti hraṁ nair(-)ṛtāya śrīgorakṣanātha śrīṁ koṇanai(##-)

oṃ prācyāṃ paścima hrīṁ varuṇa devatākādhyāya śrīgurugorakṣanāthadiśi 
paścimaṃ rakṣa rakṣa svāhā || 

oṃ vāyavya śrīgurugorakṣanāthavāyudevatākādhyāyakoṇaṃ vāyavyaṃ rakṣa 
rakṣa svāhā || 

oṃ uttare dhanādhipa hrīṁ śrīṁ gorakṣanātha hrīṁ kubera devatākādhyāya 
uttaradiśaṃ rakṣa rakṣa svāhā || 

oṃ īśāne hraṁ gorakṣanāthāya śrīṁ evaramūrtaye śrīṁ mahādevatākādhyāya 
koṇaṃ īśānaṃ rakṣa rakṣa svāhā || 

oṃ ākāśe ūrdhve śrīgorakṣanātha śrīṁ prakṛti māyākādhyāya hrīṁ ūrdhva 
bhāgaṃ rakṣa rakṣa svāhā || 

oṃ antarikṣe arini hrīṁ gorakṣanātha hriṁ śrīṁ klīṁ antarikṣabhāgaṃ rakṣa rakṣa 
svāhā ||

oṃ adhaḥ bhāge śrīgorakṣanātha krīpṛthvī devatākādhyāya gurugorakṣanātha 
māṃ pṛthvī bhāge rakṣa rakṣa svāhā || 

iti digbaṃdhanam || atha pūjākarmamaṃtraḥ ||

āvāhanasya maṃtraṃ ca śṛṇu bho tvaṃ varānane |
āgacha brahmaputratvaṃ rudra aṃśasamanvitaḥ ||7||

sthiro bhava mahādeva yāvat pūjāṃ karomi te |
paścānmūlena daśadhā śodhayed gurumaṃtrataḥ ||8||

tataḥ nyāsaṃ samādhāya dhyānapuṣpasamarcayet |
oṃ eṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gurugorakṣa hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ ||

<8b>

oṃ eṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gnauṁ gurugorakṣatarjanībhyāṃ namaḥ ||

oṃ eṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ raṁ gurugorakṣamadhyamābhyāṃ namaḥ | oṃ eṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ 
kṣuṁ gurugorakṣa anāmikābhyāṃ namaḥ || oṃ eṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ lāṁ 
gurugorakṣakaniṣṭhikābhyāṃ namaḥ || oṃ eṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ naṁ 
gurugorakṣakaratalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || 

evaṃ krameṇa hṛdayādi ||

daṇḍavat praṇamāmyahaṃ || gorakṣagurunāthabhārgavamukhāsanyaṃ 
pṛyādātmikā sarveśaṃ śiva aṃśayaṃ |
pratamukhākarṇādhyā kuṇḍalo jvalām || patmīmāma bhayaṃjitā paśupatiṃ 
śrīsundarī sevakāṃ vaṃdehaṃ gurupaṃkajaṃ hara haraḥ puṣpāṇi gṛhyaṃ kuru ||

iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ || atha snānam ||

mandākinyādi yamunāgaṃgāyāsaritodakam ||

hriṁ śrīṁ śrīṁ gurugorakṣaṃ snānāni pratigṛhyatām ||
payodadhi ghṛtaṃ caiva śarkarāmadhumiśritam ||

aṣṭasiddhāya gurave amṛtaṃ pratigṛhyatām ||
nānātīrthodakaṃ suddhaṃ nirmalaṃ puṣpamiśritam ||

snānārthaṃ gurudevasya snānaṃ me pratigṛhyatām |
śrīkhaṇḍacandanairgaṃdhaiścandanādi manoharaiḥ ||

lepanaṃ karaṇaṃ rudra candanaṃ pratigṛhyatām |
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gurugorakṣasiṃdūraṃ ghṛtasaṃyutam ||

saṃgrāme jayamāpnoti siṃduraṃ pratigṛhyatām |
raktacaṃdanakaṃ divyaṃ gaṃdhāḍhyaṃ sumanoharam ||

gurudevaprītyarthaṃ raktagaṃdhaṃ pragṛhyatām |
cākṣataṃ kuṇḍasaṃyuktaṃ javāditilasaṃyutam ||

gṛhāṇagurugorakṣaṃ akṣataṃ pratigṛhyatām |
nānāpuṣpādikaṃ divyaṃ gaṃdhādyaṃ sumanoharam ||

<9a>

nānāvarṇasamāyuktaṃ puṣpādi pratigṛhyatām |
bilvapatrādikairmālāṃ grathitā sumanoharāṃ ||

gurudevādi prītyarthaṃ mālādi pratigṛhyatām |
ūrṇasūtraiḥ grathitāni mūlamaṃtreṇa sodhyataṃ ||

rudragraṃthisamāyuktaṃ upavītaṃ pratigṛhyatām |
gairikādi manoharyoṃ vastrākārpāsasaṃbhavām ||

gurudevāya prītyarthaṃ vasanaṃ pratigṛhyatām |
nādaṃ ādeśatāṃ śabdaṃ vādyaṃ(?) ghoṣe(?)nasaṃyutām ||

gatadanta bhavaṃ kāṣṭhaṃ nādaṃ yatpratigṛhyatām |
dhūpaṃ nānāsugaṃdhādi sugaṃdhagugulādikam ||

silhakaṃ haraṇaṃ pāpaṃ dhūpoyaṃ pratigṛhyatām |
dīpaṃ nānāvidhaṃ teja kārpāsaghṛtasaṃyutam ||

dhvāntaṃ nivāraṇārthāyaṃ dīpoyaṃ pratigṛhyatām |
bījapūrādikaṃ suddhaṃ raṃbhākadalisaṃyutam ||

dhatturapanasāmnādi phalāni pratigṛhyatām |
nānābhakṣyādi vastūni miṣṭhānnādi samanvitam ||

ātmānaṃ prīṇanārthāya naivedyaṃ pratigṛhyatām |
kuru grahaṇasarvāṇi arpitāni mayā prabho ||

gurutvaṃ sarvadevānāṃ tarpayāmi surārasam |
yāsurā sā umā devi yā surā brahma īśvarā ||

yā madya sa svayaṃ viṣṇuḥ sarvadevāḥ surāsurāḥ |
tridravya sarva annānāṃ vṛkṣādīnāṃ sambhavam ||

tarpayāmi mahādeva gurugorakṣa dhīmatā |

oṃ āditya devatācāryo gurugorakṣanātha aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ 
meghavarṇabhairavanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ ||

brahmāṇḍairmatsyasaṃyuktāṃ meghaṃ triraṃgasaṃyutām ||

<9b>

surādhārācākṣatena māṃsena tarpayiṣyatām ||

matsyaṃ māṃsaṃ ca mudrāṃ ca madhumadyaṃ ca saṃyutām |
makāraḥ paṃcasuktaṃ gorakṣaṃ pūjayāmyaham ||

oṃ aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gorakṣanātha asitāṅga bhairavanātha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
tarpayāmi namaḥ ||

oṃ aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gorakṣanātha rudrabhairavanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
tarpayāmi namaḥ ||

oṃ aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gorakṣanātha candrabhairavanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
tarpayāmi namaḥ ||

oṃ aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gorakṣanātha krodhabhairavanātha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
tarpayāmi namaḥ ||

oṃ aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gorakṣanātha unmatta bhairavanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
tarpayāmi namaḥ ||

oṃ aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gorakṣanāthakapālī bhairavanātha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
tarpayāmi namaḥ ||

oṃ aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gorakṣanāthabhīṣaṇabhairavanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
tarpayāmi tarpayāmi namaḥ ||

oṃ aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gorakṣanāthasaṃhārabhairavanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
tarpayāmi namaḥ ||

oṃ śrīṁ gurugorakṣanātha pralomānandanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi tarpayāmi 
namaḥ ||

iti tarpaṇamaṃtrāṇi sākṣādyogeśvarī sadā ||

bhṛtyañśrīgurugorakṣanamāmi sundarī priya |
tato nīrājanaiḥ sārddhaṃ maṃtrameṣamudīrayet ||

karpūracaṃdrakoṭīnāṃ sundaraṃ tejarūpiṇam |
karpūradīpaṃ gṛhāṇa gurunātha namostute ||

yathāśakti japaṃ kuryāt kīlakaṃ karma kurvatā |
gorakṣakīlakaṃ yeṣāṃ śṛṇutvaṃ bho varānane ||

ghogeśvarāya devāya kulaśuddhāmbarāya ca |
yogeśvarāya yogāya yogīnāṃ pataye namaḥ ||

<10a>

dharmeśvarāya dharmāya sādhūnāṃ pataye namaḥ |
dhīrāya buddhi rūpāya kuleśāya namo namaḥ ||

sarvametanmanāmastu maṃtrāṇāmapi kīlitam |
sopikṣemamavāpnoti gorakṣaṃ tanna saṃśayaḥ ||

jalaṃdharo mahāsiddhā maṃtrajāpye manojaya |
asyā svarūpo bhagavān gopīcaṃdro mahānṛpa ||

caṃdrasena suto dhīmān mātyakaṇakāṃbhidha |
guru kṛtyartha śrīyogī jalaṃdhara sureśvarī ||

viśvaketo mahākṣetre naimiṣāraṇyavāsinaḥ |
gorakṣamaṃtraṃ prajapennityaṃ sakāsādguruvākyataḥ ||

dvādaśaṃ chaṃtu niḥsaṃkaṃ meṣāṇāmapi kīlitam |
bhikṣūkarūpabrahmāṇḍe dehi bhikṣā gṛhe gṛhe ||

cacārasarvayogeśi bhikṣāṇāmapi kīlitam |
gopīcaṃdra naraśreṣṭha amātya sahitaṃ gatā ||

sa gṛhe praviśantasminmanitaṃ paṃcaviṃśati |
strīṇāṃ ca ṣaṭśatānīkaṃ gopīcaṃdra nṛpasya ca ||

jānītvāṃ yogamadhātā(?) jalaṃdhara gamiṣyati |
gopī caṃdra pure rātrau āgamiṣyati gopure ||

śabdaṃ cakāranādena vegaṃ gatvā nṛpadhvaja |
guruṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā daṇḍavat patito bhuvi ||

gorakṣarūpo bhagavāñjālaṃdhara namostute |
amātyaputrakaṇakana āgatyaguroḥ pure ||

śāpaṃ cakārakopena kaṇakābhidhaduḥkhitā |
lajjito bhrāṃta hṛdayo loma saṃtāpamaṃdadhī ||

pretānna bhuṃji śreṣṭhatva bhaviṣyati sa bhūtale |
iti śāpaṃ cakārā śugopīcaṃdrasya āgamat ||

<10b>

prāptā tapovane ghoraṃ siṃhavyāghrādi saṃyute |
gorakṣanāthamaṃtraṃ tu kīlitamapi kīlitam ||

vivāhādiṣu dānādi punaḥ kṛtvā jalaṃdharaiḥ |
gopī candrāya nṛpate yogena ca valena ca ||

guruṇādīkṣitāpaliṃprāpnuyaṃti naresvara |
kāle putravatī nārī putraṃ tyaktā divaṃgatā ||

yogīśiṣya nṛpaśreṣṭha mātṛhīne subālake |
prāpyaṃ mahattaraṃ duḥkhaṃ ṣaṭvarṣaiḥ yoṣitā svayam ||

ṣaṭvarṣaprāpya kāle tu guraveṇaiva kathyata |
bho bho śiṣya nṛpaśreṣṭha ghātaghāta ime śiśu ||

na laṃghayitvā vākyaṃ yadguru āśāṃ karoti cet |
khaḍgena ghātitaṃ putraṃ guru ājñā ca mānitā ||

tajjalaṃdharakairdṛṣṭvā harṣayāmā sa pārvati |
punaḥ siddhena vākyena bodhayāmā sa śiṣyatam ||

bho śiṣya bho nṛpaśreṣṭha tava māyākvatagatā |
svaputramāt hīnasya kṣaṇamātreṣu pātita ||

iti gururvaca śrutvā gopīcaṃdramatho bravīt |
namohamāyā na balaṃ ca buddhiṃ guro sakāsāttama kiṃ na cāsti ||

gururvalaṃ bhinna na cāstimahyaṃ kṣamasva sarve gurubhārgaveṇa bhavān 
kṛtājñā mama pūrvakāle strīpatirājya mama tyajyatāsmi ||

bhogādi sarvaṃ mamatyajyatosmi bhavānmahāpaṃkajapādakāraṇāt ||

punappyarhapāṇi grahādi kārya bhavān mahājñā mama dhāritosmi ||

guroranujñā mamamānyatosmi vilāsasīlā mama karmatosmi ||

<11a>

bhavet putramekaṃ mahāmohajālenaṣṭe ca mātṛna ca poṣaṇaṃ ca |
śiśomena ca yasmin sutapālyatosmi guroranujñā iha ghātitosmi ||

kimatra citraṃ gurunāthabhārgava ājñāṃ kuru svārtha paro viciṃtya |
śrutvā imaṃ śiṣya vaco varānane mahānmahānanda bhavet tadantare ||

punarjalaṃdharo vākyaṃ vakṣayāmāsasikṣatam |
śṛṇuśiṣya vaco mahyaṃ dhanyatvaṃ buddhimānnaraḥ ||

svārthamāyā ca sarveṣāṃ paramārtha viciṃtya ca |
puna śṛṇu mahāśiṣya pākaṃ kuruśiśuryathā ||

māṃsāni khaṇḍakhaṇḍaṃ ca kuruyatnaṃ mahāmate |
iti gurorvaca śrutvā putramāṃsaṃ ca pāka kṛt ||

kṛtvā ca guru devāya arpayāmāsa pārvati |
dṛṣṭvā cedguru siddhena gopīcaṃdrāya vākyataḥ ||

bhuṃkṣva śiṣya mahābhāga ardhamāsaṃ ca bhujya ca |
datvā ca nirdayā rūpāt jalaṃdhara harīśvaraḥ ||

yasmin gurorvaca śrutvā mahāsaṃkaṣṭa prāpnutā |
gopīcaṃdra naraśreṣṭa anukūlaṃ vidhāṣpati ||

putrāmīṣaṃ kathaṃ bhakṣa kathaṃ laṃghya gururvaca |
ciṃtayāmāsamanasi naraśreṣṭho kuleśvara ||

siddhena dṛṣṭvājñākāśaṃ vaco na ca bodhayat |
gopīcaṃdrasutāmāṃsaṃ grāsamekaṃ svayaṃ bhujet ||

ekaṃ kīlaṃ ca ākāśādgorakṣamaṃtreṇa kīlitam |
tato na bhakṣet śiṣyeṇa punargrāsāni bhuṃjita ||

drutaṃ yatkīlakaṃ maṃtraṃ ākāśād gorakṣasya ca |
gata dṛṣṭā ca ākāśād guruṇā yaṃtra kīlitam ||

<11b>

manojavaṃ manoghoṣamekayojana urdhavaḥ |
jalaṃdharā śrama(?) dṛṣṭāmekagrāsaṃ svayaṃ bhujet ||

ardhayojana ākāśād gopī caṃdreṇa kīlayat |
dvitīya khaṇḍamāṃsaṃ ca punarāgrahamātra ca ||

bhasma bhavatarasā vāyunā harati kṣaṇāt |
maṃtraṃ kīlita gorakṣa mahāsiddheśvara priyaḥ ||

etatkīlaka māhātmya mayākurvan maheśvari |
caṃdrasūryoparāgeṣu jaleṣasatijāpyata ||

catvāriṃśati ślokāni jale sthitvā ca pāṭhayat |
sparśe tu mokṣakāleṣu kaṭimā vṛtate gatā ||

gorakṣamaṃtrāṇi sarveṣāṃ kīlaṃ bhavati niścitaḥ |
stavarāja maheśāni gorakṣasya śṛṇu priye ||77||

[iti śrīkalpadrumavivekinyāṃ yogābhyāse haragaurīsaṃvāde pūjāvyākhyāne 
gorakṣaguṭikāyāṃ śrīgurugorakṣanāthakīlakoddhāraṇanāma  
paṃcamastaraṅgaḥ] ||5||


śrīgurugorakṣanāthāya namaḥ ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca ||

śṛṇu priye mahadgopyaṃ stavarājaṃ ca gorakṣa |
mahāpuṇyavato gaurī śrīguropādaciṃtakā ||1||

oṃ asya śrīgurugorakṣastavarājastotra maṃtrasya śrībhairava ṛṣiḥ 
paṃkticchaṃdaḥ śrīgorakṣanāthadevatā śrīṁ bījaṃ hrīṁ śakti chatradharā 
kīlakaṃ yogībhūṣaṇasobhārthe jape viniyogaḥ ||

śrībījenāda haste paramamunipateḥ sārade mukti rūpe śakteḥ sādhye prayukteḥ 
paramahalabhate siddhi rūpe purāṇe ||

<12a>

vīre nṛtyamaheśe suraguru paramabrahma putre mahātmye māyāmohe vilāse 
narakulasukhadeyogamūrtiṃ namāmi ||

dhairye buddhi svarūpesusurabhi udaye dhyāyate śuddhamūrte māne mokṣe ca 
siddhe jana bhayaharaṇe vedarūpe sugaṇye ||

nānāvādyesu ghoṣe taruṇanaliyute nitya jñāne suramye bhīme bhavye vinati kratu 
phalaṃ subhade śrīguroḥ pāda vande ||3||

kārye kālānta rūpe kalimalaharaṇe muktimārge dhyānāgamyesu ghoṣe 
jagajagajagate cakrarājyeṣu vāse ||

śrīcakre cakramadhye suravarajananī chatrahastesu vaṃde gorakṣarājye 
paramihalabhate śrīguroḥ pāda vande ||4||

gnūṁ gnūṁ gnūṁ golamūrte guṇanidhi satataṃ maṃtrarājesu madhye śreṣṭhe 
bhedenanāṃgepati suṣavarade dakṣiṇāmūrtisihe ||

tārāgaṇye praṇāme dharadharaṇi rājye ādeśaḥ śabdadvandvaṃ me siddhi dehī 
jahi mama ariṇāṃ śrīguroḥ pāda vande ||5||

gorakṣa go svarūpe gaṇapati gurave gaṃdhavanyādi śaile gaṃge gaṃgāsuśīrṣe 
jaṭilaṭipati mukhe ūrṇasūtropavīteḥ ||

viśve vyāptānta bhoje jahijahi ḍakinī maṃtranāśe bhūte nānāsvarūpe narapati 
sukhade nartaśīlādi vaṃde ||6||

stavarājamidaṃ gaurī paṃcaślokena saṃyutā |
mayākṛta mahādevi mahāphala yutāsubhāḥ ||

ya idaṃ paṭhate nityaṃ trikālaṃ śraddhayānvitaḥ |

<12b>

mama tulyaṃ bhavejjantu satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||7||

punargorakṣanāthasya aṣṭakaṃ saṃvidhāṣpati |
śṛṇu priye pravakṣyāmi mahāmokṣaniśāmaya ||8||

iti śrīkalpadrumavivekinyāṃ yogābhyāse haragaurīsaṃvāde gorakṣaguṭikāyāṃ 
śrīgorakṣanāthaguṭikāyāṃ śrīgorakṣanātha paṃcaratnastavarājanāmastotraṃ 
ṣaṣṭhastaraṃgaḥ ||6||


śrīmahādeva uvāca ||

oṃ asya śrīgurugorakṣanātha aṣṭakastotramaṃtrasya śrībhairava 
ṛṣiranuṣṭupchaṃdaḥ śrīgurugorakṣanāthaprasannārthe jape pāṭhe viniyogaḥ ||

oṃ namo naṃtāya gurave pulomānaṃdanāya ca |
maṃtranātha namastubhyaṃ ekanetre namāmyaham ||1||

yogirāja namastestu viśveśvara śivāya ca |
gaurikādi vāsaṃ dharāgorakṣa tvaṃ namo namaḥ ||2||

nādahasta mahāyogī bhṛguśiṣya maheśvaraḥ |
viśravā bhrātarastubhyaṃ gorakṣāya namo namaḥ ||3||

bhairavo lokanāthatvaṃ viśvavyāpi sadāśiva |
dhanyatvaṃ gurugorakṣabrahmaputra namostute ||4||

dhyānagamya parabrahma mahābrahmasvarūpiṇe |
yogīkula sadāvāsa brahmeṃdrāya namo namaḥ ||5||

yajñeśvarāya sarvāya mahāyogeśvarāya ca |
jalaṃdharāya yogāya gorakṣāya namo namaḥ ||6||

ūrṇayajñopavītāya mahāmokṣa pradāya ca |
nātha pādaṃ namastestu gorakṣāya namo namaḥ ||7||

namaḥ śivāya śāṃtāya aṇimādi priyāya ca |

<13a>

viśveśvarāya viśvāya gorakṣāya namo namaḥ ||8||

etadaṣṭaka gorakṣasya mayā kurvati pārvati |
nareṇa paṭhate nityaṃ aṣṭasiddhi samo bhavet ||9||

iti śrīkalpadrumavivekinyāṃ yogābhyāse haragaurī saṃvāde gorakṣaguṭikāyāṃ 
rakṣāṣṭakastotraṃ saptamastaraṃgaḥ ||7||


śrīmanmahāgurugorakṣāya namaḥ ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca ||

bho śailajā mahābhāgā gurugorakṣa dhīmatā |
sāndraṃ mānapure deva paṃcāṅgasya phalaṃ pathā ||1||

prāpnoti pūrayedgaurī nāmamaṣṭottaraṃ śatam |
stotraṃ mayākṛtaṃ pūrvaṃ paṃcāṃgaṃ pūraṇāya ca ||2||

sahasranāmatātulyaṃ phalaṃ prāpnoti niścitam |
arthadharmakāmamokṣe ca manovāṃchāphalapradam ||3||

nānāpāpaṃ surāpādī niṃdakā gurutalpagaḥ |
dyūtakrīḍādi pāpānāṃ jaḍamūlo bhaviṣyati ||4||

parāpavādināṃ sarve mātṛgamanapātakam |
bhaginī gamanaṃ caiva na sthirā agni tejavat ||5||

satyaṃ satyaṃ punaḥ satyametadaṣṭottaraṃ śatam |
nityaṃ paṭhati yo dhīmān tasyāṅge pāpa na sthirāḥ ||6||

vidyārthī labhate vidyāṃ dhanārthī labhate dhanam |
kanyārthī labhate kanyāṃ patnyarthī patnimāpnuyāt ||7||

yogārthī yogamāpnoti sadyomuni samākulā |
putrārthī labhate putraṃ satyaṃ satyaṃ varānane ||8||

yogeśvaro ekanetra ādeśa jñāna cakṣuṣā |
śrīguronāthagorakṣaṃ praṇamāmi sadā priye ||9||

oṃ asya śrīgurugorakṣanāthasya aṣṭottaraśatanāmastotramaṃtrasya śrībhairava 
ṛṣiranuṣṭupchandaḥ śrīgurugorakṣanātha devatā śrīṁ bījaṁ 
nādaśaktidaṇḍahastā kīlakaṃ paṃcāṃgapāṭhakṛtaphalapūraṇārthe 
śrīgurugorakṣanāthaprasannadvārā aṣṭottaraśatanāmastotra pāṭhe viniyogaḥ ||10||

atha stotram ||

gorakṣagomukhāśrīśayogī rūpasureśvaraḥ |
brahmaputra mahāteja maṃgaleśvara parvataḥ ||

pādukāśaṃkaraṃ nātha vighnarājadhuraṃdharaḥ |
śālagrāmaśāntamūrti śaileśvara vṛṣeśvaraḥ ||11||

padma netra ekanetra bahuneraḥ sukodaraḥ |
māneśvarādi mūrtiṃ ca dhanurdhara vidhīsutaḥ ||12||

pulomānandana śrīmān jñāna jñānesvaro haraḥ |
yajñeśvaro yajñakāṃtaḥ pakṣarāja umādharaḥ ||13||

viśravā bhrātaradhānyadhātunandanagorakṣa |
pulocanāpuṇyamūrti puruṣottama pauṇḍrakaḥ ||14||

paulastya pitṛbhrātā ca pitāmaha ajāya ca |
kaśyapa bhrātaro nāda yogī gaṇya guṇākaraḥ ||15||

garuḍadhvaja gopāla gopāleśvara gopakaḥ |
siddhāmaṇi gītapati saṅkarṣaṇanareśvaraḥ ||16||

paraṃ brahma paraṃ dhāma paramātmā sanātanaḥ |
parameṣṭhi jagaddhāma śrīmaṃta śrīśrīyaṃ karaḥ ||17||

śraddhāyogeśvaro yogī yogamūrti vasuṃdharaḥ |
sūryarūpa dhyānamūrti karṇasphaṭika maṇḍita ||18||

<14a>

vyālabhūṣaṇaśobhāḍhya naraśreṣṭho kṣapākaraḥ |
sphaṭikakuṇḍalakaṇṭhakāla rūpo bhayānakaḥ ||19||

viśvarūpāntako kṛṣṇa devasākṣājjanārdanaḥ |
raktāmbaro raktamūrti raktanetra kuleśvaraḥ ||20||

candranāthaḥ somanātha viśvātmā viśvanāthakaḥ |
bhuktinātha muktinātha naranātha narāntakaḥ ||21||

lambodarolambavāho lambākṣalambanābhikaḥ |
lalajihvā chatra hasto sundarī sevakopamaḥ ||22||

etadaṣṭottaraśataṃ gorakṣasya varānane |
stotraṃ paṭhati yo dhīmān gorakṣāṣṭottaraṃ śatam ||23||

mucyate sarvapāpānte cintāmaṇi bhavet priye |
iha loke sukhaṃ bhuktā cānte mukti puraṃ labhet ||24||

[iti śrīkalpadrumavivekinyāṃ yogābhyāse haragaurīsambāde gorakṣaguṭikāyāṃ 
paṃcāṅgapūraṇārthaṃ śrīgorakṣanātha 
aṣṭottaraśatanāmastotramaṣṭamastaraṅgaḥ] ||8||


śrīgurugorakṣanāthāya namaḥ ||

pārvatyuvāca ||

nāthanātha kṛpāsiṃdho trāhi māṃ lokaśaṃkaraḥ |
praṇamāmi sadā vande yogī yogeśvaraḥ prabhu ||1||

gorakṣasya mahāmaṃtra śṛṇvahaṃ bhavavākyataḥ |
prathamotpatti stotraṃ ca dvādaśākhyā dvitīyakam ||2||

tṛtīyaṃ kavacaṃ tasya caturthaṃ hṛdayastathā |
pūjāvyākhyādikaṃ sarvaṃ paṃcamaṃ kīlakaṃ tathā ||3||

<14b>

ṣaṣṭhaṃ ca paṃcaratnādi stavarājaṃ mahādbhutam |
aṣṭaka saptame stotraṃ prasādāt tava śaṃkara ||4||

paṃcāṅgapūraṇārthāya nāmamaṣṭottaraṃ śatam |
śrūyatāṃ aṣṭamaṃ sarve maṃtrataṃtrāṇi jāni hi ||5||

yaṃtrādikaṃ tu sarveṣāṃ jñātu bho lokaśaṃkaraḥ |
punargorakṣanāthasya śrotumicchāmi saṃhitā ||6||

kathaṃ sahasranāmaṃ ca kathaṃ stotramudīritāḥ |
vada sarvaṃ kṛpāsiṃdho śrotumicchāmi bho prabho ||7||

śrīmahārudrovāca ||

dhanyatvaṃ mṛgaśāvākṣi puṇyādartā bhṛṇūcchasi |
gorakṣanāthamaṃtrādī sarvaṃ vai kathayāmite ||8||

ādau śṛṇu maheśāni yogābhyāsasya janmanaḥ |
paścāt sahasra nāmāni pravakṣāmi tavādhunā ||9||

yogābhyāsasya utpatti bhaved yasmin dharātale |
purākalpe maṇīdvīpe jaganmātā virājate ||10||

kāryasādibhirasmākaṃ maṃtra aṃte prakāśataḥ |
puṣpakaṃ tatsamāhṛtya vimānaṃ paramādbhutam ||11||

mayāpyahaṃ kṛtā devi brahmāviṣṇuśca saṃyutā |
kāle divaṃ latāmūrti nirjalasthāna prāpnutā ||12||

koṭi brahmāṇḍasaṃdṛśya koṭyahaṃ brahmakoṭyaham |
viṣṇuṃ ca koṭyaṃ satyaṃ yadvai kuṇṭhaṃ parvataṃ mayā ||13||

devalokaṃ purāsarve bahudṛśya varānane |
gatvāhaṃ mahadāścaryaṃ brahmāviṣṇu mayā yathā ||14||

mahāpallavasobhāḍhyā kusumotpalasaṃyutā |
nānāvṛkṣaiḥ samāyuktā nānā pabhi virājitā ||15||

<15a>

ramye nānā mahāghānai cāpsarogaṇasevitaiḥ |
gītavādyai mahāghoṣaiḥ bahunṛtyaivarāṅganaiḥ ||16||

dṛṣṭvāvimānādbho gaurī sarvamāścarya prāpnutāḥ |
asmākamatrisaṃbhārya komalaiḥ tapasā sthitaiḥ ||17||

parāvṛtyaiśca saṃpādyai siṃhavyāghraśca hastibhiḥ |
mṛgādi sahakrīḍābhi gambhīrai nṛttaśīlabhi ||18||

śatru vargairhīna bhogairkṣairnānāmumukṣubhiḥ |
sthāne sthāne munigaṇaitapasaṃ karṣaṇai pumān ||19||

mārjāro mūṣakaiḥ krīḍān garuḍai pannagādikān |
manuṣyai rākṣasaimatvān sahakrīḍā manoharān ||20||

jalamagnimilītāsana mahadāścarya vidyatā |
gatvāmatsyādikān yāme sudhāsiṃdhu pravāhakān ||21||

vimānā dṛśyanasmākaṃ sakāśāt marma bhedikāḥ |
sukhaṃ ca paramaṃ kālāddaṃpati jñāna cakṣuṣān ||22||

maṇi ratnādikaiḥ bhogai bālukā sthānasaṃsthitaiḥ |
parṇaiḥ vyāptā mahāramyaiḥ śatayojanavistṛtaiḥ ||23||

nānāsugaṃdhairvātena pravāhairvyoma suhṛdaiḥ |
paṃktiṃ cakārayaṃtrādi samudraisye bhitā sadā ||24||

haṃsakāraṇḍa vā kīrṇaṃ cakravākādi sobhitam |
mayūrapicchanilayaṃ sadya caṃdrodayai subhaiḥ ||25||

yeṣāṃ śobhā samānītā vimānād dṛśyatāṃ yuvām |
tatkāleṣu niyamaṃ vimānaṃ tararaṃhasā ||26||

yasmin kāle trayosmākamaṣṭakātteja prāviśat |

<15b>

sarvatejo samūhena sundarī cārubhūṣitān ||27||

sundaraṃ cāru śobhāḍhyaṃ pramamaṃkaṃ prakāśitā ||28||

strīrūpaṃ yoganāmaṃ ca puṃsa abhyāsa nāmataḥ |
kanyāmekaṃ kumāraikaṃ teja asmāt prakāśitāḥ ||29||

cakāra brahmā bho gaurī svayambhū caturānana |
tadgatvā ca mahāramye sundaraṃ cātiśobhitam ||30||

nānāvarṇairbahuvidhaistrīgaṇaiḥ śobhite yathā |
brahmāviṣṇustathā mahyaṃ īśvarīpādaśaṃkaraḥ ||31||

sadāśivasya bhūrti ca pādaviṣṭarasaṃsthitāḥ |
cakrākāraṃ yaṃtrarājaṃ tadasyo parisaṃsthitāḥ ||

viśvamātā viśālākṣī bhuvaneśī maheśvarī ||32||

asmākaṃ darśayā māsa sarvavarṇeśvarī priye |
vimānaṃ tarasā kāle bhūmyai uttarasaṃsthitāḥ ||33||

strī svabhāvaṃ bhavedgaurī brahmaviṣṇu mayāpi ca |
mahadāścarya prāpnoti viruddhaviśvaraṃhasā ||34||

gatvā ca sevitāndeviṃ mātaraṃ viśva mātaram |
tasmin kāle mahāmohe prāptasevā trayo mahān ||35||

kiṃ kartavyaṃ janolokā asitāṅgādi bhairavāḥ |
pūrvakalpasya brahmaṇā sutagorakṣanāmataḥ ||36||

mamāpi aṃśapūrvasya devyāchatradharastathā |
navapuṃsaṃsthitāṃ loke anyastrī gaṇasaṃkulāt ||37||

mātraṃ tu viśvamātā syād yogābhyāse dvayomapyam(?) |
āgatya daṇḍavadbhūmau tuṣṇiṃ bhūtamivāsthitaḥ ||38||

<16a>

yogābhyāsasya bhaktīnāṃ dṛṣṭvā cejjagadīśvarī |
tataḥ prasanno jananī viśvamātā viraṃhasā ||39||

kokilaisudhurālāpai svaramohena vākyata |
bho bho yogeśa abhyāsa gaccha yathāsukham ||40||

trayoturya gururpit brahmaviṣṇu maheśvarā |
tasya aṃśasya guromāvarṇya te kiṃtusakete ||41||

bhīṣmadroṇapramukhata aśvatthāmāvikarṇata |
yudhīṣṭhiro mahāpātra vasudeva sureśvarī ||42||

iti prabhūṣitā devā yogābhyāsena mohitā |
prathamaṃ saṃtati jñānaṃ yogābhyāsāt samāhita ||43||

tasmādgaccha suraśreṣṭha aṃsasāpūjyamāpnuyāt |
sthāvare jaṃgame yestī viśveṣā sthitiraṃhasā ||44||

vatsau tau mṛgasāvākṣau loke vyāptā vabhūvatu |
yogābhyāsaṃ iti varaṃ datvā ca bhuvaneśvarī ||45||

jaganmātā vacaḥ śrutvā gatālokeśvarī purāt |
tapaṃ cakāra vidhivadyogābhyāsena saṃkulā ||46||

gotrākupravisāṃ māyāṃ kāraṇaṃ yanmaheśvarī |
asmākamapi yogeśi bhuvanāmbā purasthitāḥ ||47||

tasmin kāle gorakṣeṇa asmākaṃ ca dadau varauḥ |
bho bho brahmā mahāviṣṇu lokeśvara maheśvara ||48||

kālāntarūpī bho rudra jagadambā padaṃ bhaja |
iti gorakṣavākyāni śrutvāsmān strībhirgaṇaiḥ ||49||

vicāritaṃ manasā guru kurvati gorakṣaḥ |
śṛṇu lokeśvarī tena brahmāviṣṇu mayā kṛtaḥ ||50||

<16b>

gorakṣasya mahāstotraṃ sahasranāsaṃjñakaḥ |
bhuvaneśvaryā mahāmātrā chatrahastau mahottamau ||51||

kāryasidhyartha viśvāye mahāmokṣapradāya ca |
pūrvakalpasya kāryādi viśrutānāṃvarāne ||52||

śrīgorakṣa uvāca ||

śṛṇukānte mahādeva śṛṣṭisthityanta kārakaḥ |
pūrvakalpe bhavānmūrtyā bhagavatyā prakāśitā ||53||

tvaṃ brahmā sarvalokānāṃ māṃtrāpi tvaṃ prakāśitā |
tvaṃ viṣṇu sṛṣṭi sarveṣāṃ kartu pālana karmakṛt ||54||

tvaṃ rudrasarvalokānāṃ saṃhārakarmakṛtsadā |
gāyatrī caivasāvitrī sarasvatyādi nāmataḥ ||55||

bhakti prāpnoti te sarve bhagavatyā prasādataḥ |
sṛṣṭisthityaṃ haret kāryaṃ kṛtvā kālānta prāpnutā ||56||

brahmāpi kāla vaśagā viṣṇopi ca nirantaram |
tvaṃ ca īśa mahādeva kālasya vaśago bhavet ||57||

pūrvakalpasya brahmaṇaḥ carmaṃ kāli tatkṣaṇāt |
tatastu brahmacarmāstaṃ devitvaṃ paridhānataḥ ||58||

punajīvadadau brahma kabaṃdharūpamāsthitaḥ |
svapāda caraṇau seṣāṃ gaṇaṃ kṛtyavabhūratāḥ ||59||

tvaṃ viṣṇu vai sadā dhyānaṃ chalena vigatena ca |
vetālarūpamāsthāya yatra dṛśya surādhipaḥ ||60||

mahādeva bhūta rūpa sākṣādbhūteśvaro bhavet |
bhuvaneśvaryā sadā pṛṣṭhe cakāra sevitaṃ sadā ||61||

śrīkalpe kalpakalpasya kāryasādi bhavānvabhau |

<17a>

bhūtākabaṃdhaivetāla svayaṃ sevakamātarāḥ |
daśā indrādi sakalā valīno bhavaṃti caiva kākathā |
punaḥ sṛṣṭimicchatā satlokeśvaryā nimeṣataḥ ||63||

purāhameka kalpasya brahmaputra ca gorakṣaḥ |
rudraṃ tvaṃ brahmaṇastvaṃ ca viṣṇustvaṃ mihakalpayoḥ ||64||

ajarāmara putrohaṃ bhagavatyā prasādataḥ |
yuṣmākaṃ tu trayodevā jaganmohena mohitā ||65||

pūrvavārtā na jānāmi bho brahmā bho harīharaḥ |
asminmaṇi dvipaśudhānāmā siṃdho sureśvaraḥ ||66||

sevāṃkuru jaganmātryā prasādaṃ kuru gṛhṇitaḥ |
strī bhāvopi gatā tubhyaṃ punarlokaṃ prakāśakaḥ ||67||

sāmarthyaṃ bhavatāṃ prāptā bhuvaneśvarī prasannatā |
iti gorakṣa vākyāni śrutvātaṃ śailanaṃdinī ||68||

punarbrahmā uvācedaṃ vacanaṃ gorakṣāt |
śṛṇutvaṃ ca visālākṣi brahmavākyaṃ varānane ||69||

śrībrahma uvāca ||

bho gorakṣa mahābhāga dhanyatvaṃ mṛgalocaneḥ |
pūrvaṃ megha(?)kakalpasya putratvaṃ buddhimānnaraḥ ||70||

parādhīnā bhavedasmān saṃjñā harati gorakṣaḥ |
asmiṃkāleṣu bho putra kiṃ na jānāmi viśrutā ||71||

upāyaṃ vada bho tāta jagadīśvaryāśca sevanaṃ |
jaḍohaṃ strī svabhāvohaṃ kiṃ seve śrī prasīdati ||72||

mahādeva uvāca ||

śrībrahmaṇa vaca śrutvā gorakṣavacanamabravīt |
śṛṇutvaṃ mṛgasāvākṣi yathā bhāṣitagorakṣaḥ ||73||

śrīgorakṣa uvāca ||

<17b>

bho brahmā bho haraḥ viṣṇuḥ mama vākyaṃ śṛṇu pumān |
kalpe kalpe pumān strī sā āgatya mama sannidhi |
saptatriṃśallakṣakoṭi gatavāntaṃ manogaṇā ||76||

asmiṃ kalpasyāpi pumān upadeśaṃ daśamitaḥ |
na saṃśaya mahābhāga jagaḥ śṛṇvaṃ tu bho vidhā ||77||

ekākṣarī jaganmātryā dadaumaṃtraṃ tribhirgaṇaṃ |
saṃbaṃdhā gurugorakṣamaṃtraṃ prāptā varānane ||78||

japitohaṃ tribhirasmān pūrvasya caritaṃ samāḥ |
jānehaṃ jānitā gaurī brahmaṇāpi ca jānitā ||79||

viṣṇunāpi ca jānīhi pūrvajñātuṃ samuhataḥ |
iti jñātvā punargaurī paścācchrīgorakṣā paṃca ||80||

sahasranāmata stotraṃ cakārasmāṃ maheśvarī |
vistarācchṛṇu bho gorī gorakṣanāmasahasrakam ||81||

kakārādi kṣakārāntā nānāmaṃtra yutāya ca |
akārādi akārāntaḥ paścānnāmāni pūritaḥ ||82||

kaṃkālakālarudraśca kṛṣṇa krīṁ krīṁ svarūpakaḥ |
kālokāla khaṇḍakalpāṇa kalpakeśvaraḥ ||83||

kīrtimaṃto kīrtimāna kīrti bhairava kīrtikaḥ |
kriṃkāramaṃtrarūpaśca krīṁkāra maṃtrakārakaḥ ||84||

krīṁ bīje vāsinaśceti kālasarpa svarūpakaḥ |
karaparvata vāsī ca karaparvata rūpakaḥ ||85||

karagāṇaśca karakīrti nātha kuleśvaraḥ |
kulācārya kulaṃdhrakulaṃdharayathā bhavān ||86||

kulaśaila svarūpaśca kulānta kakalādharaḥ |

<18a>

kalānatha kālanātha kulanātha khaleśvaraḥ ||87||

kharvahā khaḍgahastāśca khaṭvāṅgadhāraṇastathā |
khiṁ khiṁ bīja svarūpā ca khriṁkāra bījavādinaḥ ||88||

khiladhārī khaleśaśca khilanāthakhilāntakaḥ |
khekāra khenivāsaśca khenātha khalapātakaḥ ||89||

khasākhasekharakhalā khasanāthakhasāntakaḥ |
khasakāra khasakeśa khasanetra khaso mukhaḥ ||90||

khaṇḍe khaṇḍa khaṇḍamūrti khaṇḍacakra svarūpataḥ |
khaṇḍanātha khūranātha khūreśvara khurādhipaḥ ||91||

gurugorakṣa gonātha gopāla gaugaveśvaraḥ |
go netragaṇanātha dhagaṇeṃdra gaṇanāyaka ||92||

gaṇanātha gaṇācārya gaṇeśvara guṇeśvaraḥ |
gnīṁ gnīṁ bījasvarūpaśca gnīṁkāra bījavādinaḥ ||93||

gayā nātha gayākāra gayeśvara gayādharaḥ |
gayāpiṇḍa svarūpaśca gayāsuraprakāśakaḥ ||94||

gayāsuraviṣāṭaśca gaṃdhamāngaṃdharūpakaḥ |
gaṃdheśvara gaṃdhavāhā gaṃdhamādana go śiraḥ ||94||

garanātha garāhāra garaleśvara gaṃgakaḥ |
gaṃgānātha gaṃgarāja gaṃgādha gaṇāntakaḥ ||96||

gāṇavidyā prakāśaśca gāṇāvidyā prakāśakaḥ |
ghaṃṭahasta ghaṃṭakarṇa ghaṃṭamūrti ghaṭeśvaraḥ ||97||

ghaṭavāsa ghaṭānātha ghiṁ ghiṁ bījeṣu vāsinaḥ |
ghanākṣara ghanācārya ghaṇeśvara ghaṇāṃtakaḥ ||98||

ghanasyāmo ghanāṃkāra ghanāṃtaka ghavargakaḥ |
ghaṭaparvata vāsī ca ghaṭoghni gāvarasakaḥ ||99||

<18b>

ghaṭaśabda prakāśaśca ghaṭakāra ghaṭo sukhaḥ |
ghṛṇi vidyā ca ghoṁkāra ghṛṇi tejasamastathā ||100||

ṅavarga ṅakarānātha ṅaṁkārabījarūpakaḥ |
ṅe rāṅa poṭaṅākāra ṅa ṭa parvatakārakaḥ ||101||

ṅaṭeśvara ṅakārāṃta ṅamukhī ṅalinastathā |
ṅa simākarṇakāraśca karṇaphāṭaka mūrtinā ||102||

carma netra carmadharaḥ carmāṭana calācalaḥ |
caṇḍikā caṇḍikā nātha caṇḍaścaṇḍa ghātakaḥ ||103||

caṇḍadaryo pahāraśca candracaṃcala locanaḥ |
caṃcalāṅga caṃdraśira candraśekharacātura ||104||

caturānana sutraśca catureśaśca caṃpakaḥ |
caṃpakeśvara śrīmaṃta caṃpanāthaṃ ca arvakaḥ ||105||

ciṃbīja carmapāṇaśca carmakāreśvarastathā |
chinnamastāpati chaṇḍa chaṇḍeyachaṇḍanāyakaḥ ||106||

chaṇḍanātha chakāraśca chalinī chyā chaleśvaraḥ |
chalanātha chalaḥ keśa chaṇḍabheda chalonmanaḥ ||107||

chalavidyā chalasaṃjñā chalabhedaśca chedakaḥ |
chedakarṇa chedamūrti chaḍaiśvara charistathā ||108||

charihasta chatradhara chatreśanāyakaḥ |
chatranātha chatravāsa chatraparvatakārakaḥ ||109||

chiṃkārachadmakāraśca channarūpakṣapākaraḥ |
jayaṃtikajāmunikajalarūpa jaleśvaraḥ ||110||

jalodarajalāsaśca jalanātha jalākaraḥ |
jalaṃdhara japajāyā jāyāpati jayākaraḥ ||111||

jvālāpati jvālāmālā jvālānātha japeśvaraḥ |

<19a>

jayamālādharajātā jātāṃdhājāti bhedakā ||112||

janmadātā janeśaśca jeyājeya svarūpaka |
japanāthaśca jīṁkāra japaparvatavāsakaḥ ||113||

jaḍeśaḥ jaḍasaṃhāra jaḍajñānopahārakaḥ |
janasiddhaśca janakajānakīpati sevakaḥ ||114||

jhapamālā jhalajhaṃlā jhaṃkeśvara jhaṣastathā |
jhapamāna jhiṃkāraśca jhīṃkāra bījavādinaḥ ||115||

jhaṃpāsuranivahaśca jhamaśabda prakāśakaḥ ||116||

jhakkā jhaṃpārvatīnātha jhaṁvargabījakārakaḥ ||117||

jhaña parvatavāsī ca jhīṃ jhikāra jhapākaraḥ |
jhalanaṃ jhālanākāra jhāpera jhāṭi rūpakaḥ ||118||

jhaṣeśvara jhakāraśca jhamāṃtakañjakārikā |
ñameñcara ñamo ñaṃtatrakāra bījavādinaḥ ||119||

ñaṃ bījarūpa śrīnātha ñaṃṭeśvara ñameśvaraḥ |
ñaṃ vagarūpa ñaṃtrīkantatrīmālā ñasāsikaḥ ||20||

ṭakāra vādinaṭiṃkaṭīkānātha ṭaleśvaraḥ |
ṭaṃkeśvaraścaṭiṁkāra ṭiṭṭiṁ bīja svarūpakaḥ ||121||

ṭala parvatavāsī ca ṭapomukha ṭipākaraḥ |
ṭaṃkanātha ṭaṃkakeśaṭaṃkalocana paṭakaḥ ||122||

ṭamarīramaronātha ṭamaravādyapraṃsakaḥ |
ṭāmareśvara ṭopāla ṭāṃkāraṭaṃkanāmasā ||123||

ṭuṃkākārya ṭaṃkapaṃtraṭuṃḍiṭuṃḍilādhipaḥ |
ṭuṃḍileśaṭuṃdanātha daṃḍanetra ṭasādhipaḥ ||124||

ṭuṃḍadeśādhipaśceti ṭuṃdadeśeśvarastathā |
ṭakāraśabda ṭāṃkāra ṭakapālāśca tārakaḥ ||125||

ṭuṃkeśvara ṭuṃkanātha ṭaṃkeśa ṭarunastathā |
ṭaruṇaśvara ṭāruṇika ṭārakatripurāṃtakaḥ ||126||

<19b>

ṭhaṇḍilāṭhaṇḍilapatiḥ ṭhaṃḍileśvara ṭhāmariḥ |
ṭhunākāraṭhuṇamukhaḥ ṭhumaleśvara ṭhākuraḥ ||27||

ṭhālāpati ṭhulanātha ṭhulakeśeśvarastathā |
sthitimūrtisthiramukhasthalāvāsasthaleśvaraḥ ||28||

sthalanāthasthātu rudraścaturānana cāsaraḥ |
ḍaṃḍimukha ḍamarukāṃ taḍamaruvallabhastathā ||129||

sthūlākārasthūlamukha ḍaṃbunātha ḍapākaraḥ |
ḍapānātha ḍāmarikaḥ ḍalanāyaka ḍuṃḍubha ||130||

ḍiṁ ḍiṁ bījeśvaraścaiva hrīṁ hrīṁ bījasvarūpakaḥ |
ḍhrīṁ bīja ḍhuchakāraśca ḍhuṃ ḍhumāra ḍhaleśvaraḥ ||131||

ḍharanātha ḍhasaṃjñā ca ḍhaṃkanātha ḍhimākaraḥ |
ḍhimeśa ḍhamakāraśca ḍhuṃ ḍhuṃ śabda svarūpakaḥ ||132||

ḍharāṃtaka ḍhālarūpa ḍhaḍhārūpa ḍharīmukhaḥ |
ḍhārāḍhīreśvaraśceti ḍhatulānāḍhalaneśvaraḥ ||133||

ṇāśabdarūpinaṇāmaṇādagarṇalilembaraḥ |
ṇalinaṇālinaṃ ṇādi ṇādaṇādeśvarastathā ||134||

ṇāṭaṃkābījavāsaśca talātalanivāsakaḥ |
tejamūrti tejakaratalpa talpeśvarastathā ||

taruṇa sūryatāruṇi katamakeśatamāntakaḥ |
tejakāṃtastejanātha taruṇeśvara tāṇḍavaḥ ||136||

tarurṇāvamūrtiśca taruṇakāṃta tatuṃruṣā |
tālavṛkṣasvarūpaśca tālaśabda prakāśakaḥ ||137||

talaparvatavāsī ca talanāthatari yathā |
trīṁkāra bījarūpaśca trīṁkāra svaranālikaḥ ||138||

tārakāsuraghātaśca tārakeśvaratārakaḥ |
tārakarma svarūpaśca tripureśvara tāṃtrikaḥ ||139||

tripuranātha trāṇarūpa tripuchatradhāraṇaḥ |

<20a>

tripuraparvatādhīśa tripuraparvateśvaraḥ ||140||

tripurasthānavāsaśca tripurādeva sevakaḥ |
tripurāsura aṃtaśca taṃtrika tāṃtrikī yathā ||141||

taṃtranātha taṃtrarūpataṃtakāsuraghātakaḥ |
taṃtreśvara taṃtramaya taṃtrītrāṇeśvarastathā ||142||

talpapayatalpanātha talpakāntataleśvaraḥ |
thalavāsa thalakarṇa thālī thālādi rūḍhakaḥ ||143||

thālī pṛyaṃ thaṃtha śabda tha tha varṇeśvarastathā |
dāmarī damarodāma dīmodara dayākaraḥ ||44||

dayādhārī dayākānta damanaṃ dambikodaraḥ |
dāntikautuhalaṃ kuṇḍa damanāsuramardanaḥ ||145||

damanapuṣpa priyakadamayaṃti patistathā |
dāruṇa dāruṇādhīśa dāneśadānarūpakaḥ ||146||

dānapuṇya svarūpaśca dharmadhvajadharādharaḥ |
dhārārūpa dharākāṃta dhāraṇaśca dhuraṃdharaḥ ||147||

dhuraṃdhareśvaraḥ dhīrā dhīsvarūpadhaneśvara |
dhanvantarī dhyānanātha dhyāneśvara dhalāṃtakaḥ ||148||

dharmeśvara dharmarūpa dhrīṁ śabdadharaṇīdharaḥ |
dharaṇīnātha dhanyātmā dhārmika dhamaleśvaraḥ ||149||

dhanyaḥ gurudhanyarūpa dhanyanātha dhanāntakaḥ |
nārāmaṇanareśaśca nararūpa nṛpadhvajaḥ ||150||

nāṭyarūpa nṛtyanātha naranātha nareśvaraḥ |
nararakṣākaranīla nīlanātha narāntakaḥ ||151||

nīlakāntayaśabhrāta yamarāja sahodaraḥ |
pūrṇacaṃdra pūrṇakāṃta pūrṇeśa pūrṇimāpatiḥ ||152||

padmanābha padmanātha padmākṣa padmarūpakaḥ |
pākhaṇḍapāpi nāśaśca parvata pārvatipati ||153||

<20b>

pāśahasta palārūpa pāśīpāśeśvarastathā |
pātrapriyo pātradharapātre pātrasvarūpaka ||54||

pṛyā vā pṛyārūpa priyānātha palāsayoḥ |
pītāmbara dharapītapitātvaṃ putrarūpakaḥ ||155||

pauṇḍreśa puṇḍrarūpaṃ ca puṇḍarīkākṣa pāṇini |
pātakī khaṇḍarūpaṃ ca pāṇḍavāvaradāyakā ||56||

pāṇḍaveśapāṇḍunātha phakirāphakireśvaraḥ |
phatkireśvaraḥ phikhaṇḍaḥ phālāsana phaṇḍatathā ||157||

phriṁkāra bījavādī ca bījeśa baladāyakaḥ |
balākara balānātha baleśvara vināyakaḥ ||158||

bindurūpabindāvidyādhipastathā |
vidyādhara virūpākṣa viṣṇu tvaṃ vimalastathā ||159||

viṣesātta vaiśyarūpa vaiśyanātha viḍambaraḥ |
bileśvara bilvapriya bilāsa varuṇeśvaraḥ ||160||

veśyāpati vedarūpa vāruṇī pṛyavālhikaḥ |
bālasapabālanātha balāntakaḥ ||161||

vīramūrti balonmatta vāgmatī jalarūpasā |
bāṇahastapāṇarūpa vāṇanātha vasīkaraḥ ||162||

vaśīkaraṇanāthaṃ ca vināśavinarūpakaḥ |
vāyunāthavāyurūpa vāyunāśakarastathā ||163||

bhagaṃdhara bhagākāra bhaganāthaṃ ca bhairavaḥ |
bheṣīdharaḥ bheṣinātha bheṣīrakṣakabhillatā ||164||

bharuṇīkāṃta bhrātā ca bharuṇīnātha bhrṁtathā |
mahākālamahārudra mahādeva manurmaṇiḥ ||165||

maṇikaṃṭha manarmānaṃ māninīkāṃtamauktikaḥ |
māhānātha māhānetra mahāvedamāhāsuraḥ ||166||

<21a>

muktamālāmokṣarūpa mokṣajvālā narādhipaḥ |
palāpalāṃdhipayajanātha yameśvaraḥ ||167||

ralakāntara lanātha raleśvararathādhipaḥ |
rathavāhāraladharā ralakārakaralakaḥ ||168||

ramākāntaramānātha rājeśvara rajoguṇaḥ |
rajaparvatavāsī ca rajaparvatakarakaḥ ||169||

rajeśvararājarūpa rajanātha rayomukhaḥ |
lalanālākinī nātha laṃkeśodarpanāśakaḥ ||70||

lajjāpati laṃbaśikha lambajñāna lapaṃkaraḥ |
lapamūrti laṃbanātha lājāpriya laṭhāḥkaraḥ ||171||

laṭeśvara lambamukha lambāsura nivarhaṇaḥ |
vananāvanimāmāravajanāvātivātulaḥ ||172||

śeṣamūrti śeṣanātha śeṣeśvara śaśāṃkaka |
śaktisiddhi siddhinātha śileśvara simākaraḥ ||173||

ṣiṁ bīja ṣalugāṃdhāra ṣasāṃtaṣānamāturaḥ |
ṣaganātha ṣaṃgamuṣaṣasī mukha ṣaleśvaraḥ ||174||

sālva sālvapatī sānta sāntanātha śaśīdharaḥ |
śaśinetra śaśimukha śāmbaśāmbheśvarastathā ||175||

śrīśaśca śrīmukha śrembāśrīpākarasvaresvaraḥ |
śaraṇāgata rūpaṃ ca śaraṇāgatarakṣakaḥ ||176||

halīhalimukhahāla hāleśvara hayomukhaḥ |
hayanātha hayajñāna hayārī nāśahāṭakaḥ ||177||

hāṭakeśvara hrīṁkāra hatyāmocana hālanaḥ |
hetopadeśa hetuṃśca hetukāraka hiṁkaraḥ ||178||

hiṃvīrvarga svarūpaṃ ca hrībīje vāsakārakaḥ |
hanumatsakhahomasahā homasvarūpakaḥ ||179||

harinnetraśca hariṇa harinmāṃsa harīmukhaḥ |
harāṃśahararūpaṃ ca hareśvara hayaṃkaraḥ ||180||

rūpanetrā hanumatā haranātha harīśvarāḥ |
hālānātha hālahatāṃtaka haṭeśvaraḥ ||181||

heramba hanugaṃdharva halisādhipaharmayaḥ |
hananaṃ hāni rūpaṃ ca haṭamūrti halāyudhaḥ ||182||

kṣetrajña kṣetrajakṣetrī kṣetrīśakṣatramardanaḥ |
kṣārarūpa kṣatradharakṣatranāyachādanaḥ ||183||

kṣetrarūpa kṣatrapati kṣāṃti rūpakṣapeśvaraḥ |
kṣapānātha kṣamānātha kṣetreśvara chalīmukhaḥ ||184||

kṣātradharmaprakāśaśca kṣātradharmaśca nāyakaḥ |
kṣaurakarmeśvarakṣaura kṣauragaṃdharva kṣemaja ||185||

kṣatraparvatavāsaśca kṣatraparvatakārakaḥ |
kṣatrīmardanarūpaṃ ca kṣatrokrodha svarūpakaḥ ||186||

kṣatrīrudhirarūpaṃ ca kṣatrīvalasvarūpakaḥ |
kṣatrīmaṃtra vipākaṃ ca kṣāmikā kṣiṁkṣapākaraḥ ||187||

kṣatrīsaṃhārakartā ca kṣatrījñānaprakāśakaḥ |
kṣāravārī svarūpaśca kṣātrāvīryasvarūpakaḥ ||188||

kṣameśvara kṣatrapati kṣatranātha kṣapākaraḥ |
kṣapākareśvara kṣudrakṣaura dharmakṣamānidhi ||189||

kṣatrīśastra svarūpaṃ ca kṣatrīprāṇeśvarastathā |
kṣarajakṣīrarūpaṃ ca kṣīṇamūrtidharastathā ||190||

aryamā arināthaṃ ca arisaṃhārakārakaḥ |
arivargaprakāśaśca ariṇī aruṇeśvaraḥ ||191||

atrivasaprakāśaśca ayonijaprakāśakaḥ |
abjanaṃdana asthi ca asthika svara atrijaḥ ||192||

anumatā atrikā ca atrinātha ayomukhaḥ |

<22a>

agniśca agnajanmā ca arkamaṇḍala arkajaḥ ||193||

arkatejasvarūpaśca arkamaṃtraprakāśakaḥ |
arkanātha arka aṃśa āditya ādirūpakaḥ ||194||

ādijñāna ādinātha ārtikeśvara agnigāḥ |
ādideva ādiyogī ādeśa ārtakāntakaḥ ||195||

āliṃgana āruṇisa ānandeśvara āṃtaraḥ |
ādilokeśvara ālī āsīviṣa svarūpakaḥ ||196||

āsībhūṣaṇadhartā ca āsījñāna prakāśakaḥ |
āsītanādhipaṃ āsa āśārūpeśvarastathā ||197||

āśānātha āgnahika āgnaheśvara hatyakaḥ |
ityācārya duṣṭarūpa duṣṭāgraha haleśvaraḥ ||198||

ilāvṛtta nivāsaśca ilānātha ilāṃtakaḥ |
ilāmārgaprakāśaśca iṣṭeśvara imānidhī ||199||

iti śabda prakāśaca itihāsa svarūpakaḥ |
iti gaṃdhasvarūpaśca iti sthāna nivāsakaḥ ||200||

ityarthamaṃtrarūpaśca iliṃgeśvara indriyaḥ |
indrarūpa indranātha indreśvara umāpati ||201||

umākānta umānātha umāniṣi umākaraḥ |
ugranāthaśca ugreśa ugrācārya umāsajaḥ ||202||

umeśvarā uttareśo uttarākhaṇḍavāsakaḥ |
utrīrūpa utpattika utpatteśvara ugrajaḥ ||203||

ugratārāsevakaśca ūgraparvatakārakaḥ |
ugrasena sutāhaṃtī ugracaṃdra ṛtustathā ||204||

ṛturāja ṛtupriya ṛtupuṣpa priyastathā |
ṛtujñānavibhāgaśca ṛtu maṃtreśvarastathā ||205||

ṛtubaṃdhu ṛtupriya ṛtaveśvararaṃtika |

<22b>

raṃtideva ṛtu priyo ṛtuvīrya svarūpakaḥ ||206||

ṛryamā ca ḷmārgaśca laṃkeśo prāṇaghātakaḥ |
ḷvarṇabījarūpā ca ḷvarga varṇarūpakaḥ ||207||

ḷṃnātharāsamā satya rā rā maṃtrasvarūpakaḥ |
aiṁkāra aiṁ namovāṇī aiṁndraparvata vāsakaḥ ||208||

oṇḍrapuṣpa priyakara odravartika oṃ namaḥ |
odraparvatavāsī ca odravidyā svarūpakaḥ ||209||

āṭaghāta omamā otṛ oturvidyā svarūpakaḥ |
oturnātha otukara odrukāṃta ogaṃdhalaḥ ||210||

audyānavāsi auṃkāra auṁ vidyā ausamaḥ nidhi |
auṃtigaṃdhāvatī autya aucaparvata vāsakaḥ ||211||

aurvāsuravidyātaśca aurvakaṃṭhi aṭeśvaraḥ |
aurvatejavata aulī aulīṃdhara dharastathā ||212||

auliṃganātha auliṃga auliṃgeśvara śrīpatiḥ |
asura aṇḍajānātha aṇḍeśvarasubhaṃkaraḥ ||213||

antakeśvara ākāra aṃkanāthāṃtakeśvara |
aṃtakartika aṃkāra aṁbīja antarūpakaḥ ||214||

aṃtrāsura nivarhaśca ātapatra sudhāraṇaḥ |
aṃkārabījavāsaśca aṇḍa atryaṃtaresthitaḥ ||215||

aṇḍamātamanāmaśca akāravarṇarūpakaḥ |
atalokarūpaśca ataleśvara arvagaḥ ||216||

agnimaṇḍalavāsī ca agnimaṇḍalarūpakaḥ |
agnikāntisvarūpaśca agnistaṃbhanarūpakaḥ ||217||

aśvavāhā aśvaśira aśvalocana aṃtikaḥ |
aduputra adupati aśleṣāpati adbidhaḥ ||218||

<23>

anyadbhujaṃ mahāmūrti mahālocana tāṇḍavaḥ |
yakṣayakṣapati artha ajñānatītha rūpakaḥ ||219||

aśaktamūrti bhagavānbhillamiṣa asāyakaḥ |
gorakṣanātha aṃtyeṣu iti nāmnādaśaṃ śatam ||220||

asmākena kṛtaṃ stotraṃ gorakṣasya ca pārvati |
sahasranāma paramaṃ yogīnāṃ caiva durlabham ||221||

rāgiṇāṃ ca virāgīṇāṃ yogīnāṃ ca gṛhasthinām |
nityaṃ paṭhati yo dhīmān prasanno bhava gorakṣa ||222||

sahasranāma paramaṃ stotraṃ sahasraguṇasaṃyutam |
sahasrajñānasaṃyuktaṃ sahasrasiddhisaṃyutam ||223||

sahasravidyāsaṃyuktaṃ sahasratuṇḍaleśvari |
ciṃtāmaṇi bhavedbhakta janā ānandakāritā ||224||

gorakṣatulyo bhavati nānāmaṃtraprakāśakaḥ |
nityaṃ trikāle paṭhati trirāvṛtta maheśvari ||225||

candrasūryasya parveṣu sparśamokṣānta paṭhyataḥ |
gatasaṃkhyā kṛtāvipraṃ bhojanaṃ sādhakairdade ||226||

iti gorakṣanāthasya aṅgapūrita bho pṛye |
śrīgorakṣaprasannostu asmākaṃ dṛśyata tribhiḥ ||227||

paścāt siddhiṃ dadātithya bhuvaneśī prasannatā |

[iti śrīkalpadrumavivekinyāṃ yogābhyāse haragaurīsambāde gorakṣaguṭikāyāṃ 
śrīgorakṣanāthasahasranāmastotraṃ nāmanavamastaraṅgaḥ] ||9||




